"<b>Frame stack</b>"
"<p>Often referred to as the \"call stack\", this is a list showing what function is currently active and who called each function to get to this point in your program. By clicking on an item you can see the values in any of the previous calling functions."
msgstr ""
"<b>Rahmenstapel</b>"
"<p>Faken ok \"Oproop-Stapel\" nöömt, wiest disse List de opstunns aktive Funkschoon, un wokeen de Funkschonen op den Padd na dissen Punkt in Dien Programm opropen hett. Wenn Du op de Indrääg klickst, kannst Du de Weerten in all verleden Oproopfunkschonen bekieken."

